            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53261472?u=cacf1f6f7b5a19191e176a601272920e806d8831&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Changed <code class=\"notranslate\">˙highlightColor</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">hiliteColor</code> and added <code class=\"notranslate\">insertLineBreak</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the readers to have up to date informations.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/editing/docs/execCommand/\" rel=\"nofollow\">w3c</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43634.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4177387218\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43634\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43634/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43634\">#43634</a></p>",
