        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43624.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4171329635\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43624\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43624/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43624\">#43624</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds a note that for audio to be lazy loaded the <code class=\"notranslate\">controls</code> attribute needs to be set.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've also intended the lazy-loading stuff under the <code class=\"notranslate\">loading=lazy</code> attribute as they don't apply to the <code class=\"notranslate\">loading</code> attribute overall.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clarification in case this is not obvious</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Small update to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4072910479\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43434\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43434/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43434\">#43434</a> when I added these docs.</p>\n",
