        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds the “How to sunset a section of content” guide.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To describe the process for retiring entire sections of MDN Web Docs content.</p>",
